#: src/Modules/PersonaDashboard/Defaults/CoreTemplates.php:264
#: src/Shared/CoreSurfaceRegistration.php:1190
msgid "Podium"
msgstr "Podium"

#: src/Core/FeatureRegistry.php:207
msgid ""
"The Podium tile and view (team rankings and top performers). Turn off to "
"hide it from this academy."
msgstr ""
"De tegel en weergave Podium (teamranglijsten en topspelers). Zet uit om deze "
"te verbergen voor deze academie."

#: src/Core/FeatureRegistry.php:236 src/Modules/License/FeatureMap.php:405
