#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/GoalPastTargetDateAlert.php:110
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s's goal \"%2$s\" is past its target date and still open."
msgstr "Het doel \"%2$s\" van %1$s is over de streefdatum en staat nog open."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/InvitationStaleAlert.php:66
msgid "Invitation never accepted"
msgstr "Uitnodiging nooit geaccepteerd"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/InvitationStaleAlert.php:70
msgid ""
"An invitation was sent and never accepted. Usually the email went to spam or "
"to a mistyped address, and nothing anywhere says so."
msgstr ""
"Een uitnodiging is verstuurd en nooit geaccepteerd. Meestal is de e-mail in "
"de spam beland of naar een verkeerd getypt adres gegaan, en nergens is dat "
"te zien."

#. translators: %s: name or email address of the person who was invited
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/InvitationStaleAlert.php:121
#, php-format
msgid "%s was invited but has never accepted."
msgstr "%s is uitgenodigd maar heeft nooit geaccepteerd."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/InvitationStaleAlert.php:158
#: src/Modules/Threads/Subscribers/NotificationSubscriber.php:54
msgid "Someone"
msgstr "Iemand"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/MessagingNeverConfiguredAlert.php:113
msgid "No messages are being sent"
msgstr "Er worden geen berichten verstuurd"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/MessagingNeverConfiguredAlert.php:117
msgid ""
"Every message this academy could send is switched off, and nobody has chosen "
"otherwise since the install was created. Parents and players are told "
"nothing — not even that a training was cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Elk bericht dat deze academie zou kunnen versturen staat uit, en sinds de "
"installatie heeft niemand daar iets anders van gemaakt. Ouders en spelers "
"horen niets — ook niet dat een training is afgelast."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/MessagingNeverConfiguredAlert.php:148
msgid "This academy is not sending any messages yet."
msgstr "Deze academie verstuurt nog geen berichten."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/NoCoachAssignedAlert.php:38
msgid "Upcoming activity has no coach"
msgstr "Aankomende activiteit zonder trainer"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/NoCoachAssignedAlert.php:42
msgid ""
"An activity in the next week has nobody assigned to run it. Unstaffed "
"activities tend to be cancelled late, which costs every player in the squad "
"a training slot."
msgstr ""
"Voor een activiteit binnen een week is niemand ingedeeld. Activiteiten "
"zonder trainer worden vaak laat afgezegd, en dat kost elke speler in de "
"selectie een trainingsmoment."

#. translators: %s: activity name
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/NoCoachAssignedAlert.php:59
#, php-format
msgid "%s is today and has no coach assigned."
msgstr "%s is vandaag en heeft geen trainer toegewezen."

#. translators: 1: activity name, 2: number of days until it takes place
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/NoCoachAssignedAlert.php:66
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is in %2$d day and has no coach assigned."
msgid_plural "%1$s is in %2$d days and has no coach assigned."
msgstr[0] "%1$s is over %2$d dag en heeft geen trainer toegewezen."
msgstr[1] "%1$s is over %2$d dagen en heeft geen trainer toegewezen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/NoMeasurementThisSeasonAlert.php:63
msgid "No measurement this season"
msgstr "Geen meting dit seizoen"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/NoMeasurementThisSeasonAlert.php:67
msgid ""
"A player has no measurement recorded this season. Growth data is the one "
"part of the record that is not an opinion, and a missed season leaves a hole "
"in the curve that cannot be filled later."
msgstr ""
"Voor een speler is dit seizoen geen enkele meting vastgelegd. Groeidata is "
"het enige deel van het dossier dat geen mening is, en een gemist seizoen "
"laat een gat in de curve dat je later niet meer kunt vullen."

#. translators: %s: player name
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/NoMeasurementThisSeasonAlert.php:91
#, php-format
msgid "%s has no measurement recorded this season."
msgstr "Voor %s is dit seizoen geen meting vastgelegd."

#. translators: 1: player name, 2: season name
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/NoMeasurementThisSeasonAlert.php:98
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s has no measurement recorded in %2$s."
msgstr "Voor %1$s is in %2$s geen meting vastgelegd."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/ParentNeverActivatedAlert.php:60
msgid "Parent invited but never activated"
msgstr "Ouder uitgenodigd maar nooit geactiveerd"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/ParentNeverActivatedAlert.php:64
msgid ""
"A parent was invited and never created their account, and the player still "
"has no parent linked. The invitation looks sent everywhere; the family's "
"side of the record never opened."
msgstr ""
"Een ouder is uitgenodigd en heeft nooit een account aangemaakt, en aan de "
"speler hangt nog geen enkele ouder. Overal lijkt de uitnodiging verstuurd; "
"de kant van het gezin is nooit opengegaan."

#. translators: %s: player name
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/ParentNeverActivatedAlert.php:100
#, php-format
msgid "%s's parent was invited but never activated their account."
msgstr ""
"De ouder van %s is uitgenodigd maar heeft het account nooit geactiveerd."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PastStillPlannedAlert.php:36
msgid "Past activity still planned"
msgstr "Activiteit uit het verleden staat nog op gepland"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PastStillPlannedAlert.php:40
msgid ""
"An activity whose date has passed is still marked as planned. Until it is "
"completed or cancelled, its attendance and minutes are missing from every "
"report."
msgstr ""
"Een activiteit waarvan de datum voorbij is, staat nog op gepland. Zolang die "
"niet is afgerond of geannuleerd, ontbreken de aanwezigheid en de "
"speelminuten in elk rapport."

#. translators: 1: activity name, 2: number of days it has been unmarked
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PastStillPlannedAlert.php:60
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s is still marked as planned, %2$d day after it took place."
msgid_plural "%1$s is still marked as planned, %2$d days after it took place."
msgstr[0] "%1$s staat nog op gepland, %2$d dag nadat die plaatsvond."
msgstr[1] "%1$s staat nog op gepland, %2$d dagen nadat die plaatsvond."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PdpNoConversationAlert.php:56
msgid "No PDP conversation this cycle"
msgstr "Geen PDP-gesprek deze cyclus"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PdpNoConversationAlert.php:60
msgid ""
"A player's PDP file for this season is open but no conversation has actually "
"been held. The file looks complete on every list and the player has been "
"told nothing."
msgstr ""
"Het PDP-dossier van een speler voor dit seizoen staat open, maar er is nog "
"geen gesprek gevoerd. In elke lijst ziet het dossier er compleet uit en de "
"speler heeft niets te horen gekregen."

#. translators: %s: player name
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PdpNoConversationAlert.php:102
#, php-format
msgid "No PDP conversation has been held with %s this cycle."
msgstr "Er is deze cyclus nog geen PDP-gesprek gevoerd met %s."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerNotEvaluatedAlert.php:46
msgid "Player not evaluated recently"
msgstr "Speler recent niet geëvalueerd"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerNotEvaluatedAlert.php:50
msgid ""
"No evaluation has been recorded for a player for longer than the academy's "
"threshold. Nothing on any screen shows the gap, because a missing record "
"renders as nothing."
msgstr ""
"Er is voor een speler langer geen evaluatie vastgelegd dan de drempel van de "
"academie. Op geen enkel scherm is dat gat te zien, want een ontbrekende "
"registratie toont zich als niets."

#. translators: %s: player name
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerNotEvaluatedAlert.php:74
#, php-format
msgid "%s has never been evaluated."
msgstr "%s is nog nooit geëvalueerd."

#. translators: 1: player name, 2: number of weeks since the last evaluation
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerNotEvaluatedAlert.php:82
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s has not been evaluated for %2$d week."
msgid_plural "%1$s has not been evaluated for %2$d weeks."
msgstr[0] "%1$s is al %2$d week niet geëvalueerd."
msgstr[1] "%1$s is al %2$d weken niet geëvalueerd."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerTurns18Alert.php:52
msgid "Player turns 18 soon"
msgstr "Speler wordt binnenkort 18"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerTurns18Alert.php:56
msgid ""
"A player is about to turn 18. Parental consent stops being the basis for "
"holding their data, and the paperwork is easy to do a month early and "
"awkward to do a month late."
msgstr ""
"Een speler wordt binnenkort 18. Toestemming van ouders is dan niet langer de "
"grondslag om zijn gegevens te bewaren, en het papierwerk is een maand te "
"vroeg makkelijk en een maand te laat lastig."

#. translators: %s: player name
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerTurns18Alert.php:81
#, php-format
msgid "%s turns 18 today. Consent and agreement records need updating."
msgstr ""
"%s wordt vandaag 18. De vastlegging van toestemming en overeenkomst moet "
"worden bijgewerkt."

#. translators: 1: player name, 2: number of days until the birthday
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerTurns18Alert.php:88
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s turns 18 in %2$d day. Consent and agreement records need updating."
msgid_plural ""
"%1$s turns 18 in %2$d days. Consent and agreement records need updating."
msgstr[0] ""
"%1$s wordt over %2$d dag 18. De vastlegging van toestemming en overeenkomst "
"moet worden bijgewerkt."
msgstr[1] ""
"%1$s wordt over %2$d dagen 18. De vastlegging van toestemming en "
"overeenkomst moet worden bijgewerkt."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerWithoutTeamAlert.php:51
msgid "Player has no team"
msgstr "Speler zonder team"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerWithoutTeamAlert.php:55
msgid ""
"An active player belongs to no team. They have no attendance, no minutes, no "
"coverage row and no head coach — the system cannot say where they are."
msgstr ""
"Een actieve speler hoort bij geen enkel team. Er is geen aanwezigheid, geen "
"speelminuten, geen regel in de dekkingsrapportage en geen hoofdtrainer — het "
"systeem kan niet zeggen waar hij staat."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerWithoutTeamAlert.php:68
msgid "A player"
msgstr "Een speler"

#. translators: %s: player name
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/PlayerWithoutTeamAlert.php:72
#, php-format
msgid "%s is active but belongs to no team."
msgstr "%s is actief maar hoort bij geen enkel team."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/StaffCertificateExpiringAlert.php:77
msgid "Certificate expiring"
msgstr "Certificaat verloopt"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/StaffCertificateExpiringAlert.php:81
msgid ""
"One of your certificates is about to expire or has just expired. Every "
"player in the squad needs the person running their training to be qualified "
"to run it."
msgstr ""
"Een van je certificaten verloopt binnenkort of is net verlopen. Elke speler "
"in de selectie heeft er belang bij dat wie zijn training geeft daarvoor "
"gekwalificeerd is."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/StaffCertificateExpiringAlert.php:195
msgid "A certificate"
msgstr "Een certificaat"

#. translators: %s: certificate name
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/StaffCertificateExpiringAlert.php:201
#, php-format
msgid "Your %s certificate has expired."
msgstr "Je certificaat %s is verlopen."

#. translators: 1: certificate name, 2: number of days until it expires
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/StaffCertificateExpiringAlert.php:211
#, php-format
msgid "Your %1$s certificate expires in %2$d day."
msgid_plural "Your %1$s certificate expires in %2$d days."
msgstr[0] "Je certificaat %1$s verloopt over %2$d dag."
msgstr[1] "Je certificaat %1$s verloopt over %2$d dagen."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/TeamWithoutHeadCoachAlert.php:58
msgid "Team has no head coach"
msgstr "Team zonder hoofdtrainer"

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/TeamWithoutHeadCoachAlert.php:62
msgid ""
"A team with players has nobody assigned as head coach. Most alerts go to the "
"head coach, so a team without one quietly stops receiving any of them."
msgstr ""
"Een team met spelers heeft niemand als hoofdtrainer. De meeste meldingen "
"gaan naar de hoofdtrainer, dus een team zonder hoofdtrainer krijgt er "
"ongemerkt geen enkele meer."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/TeamWithoutHeadCoachAlert.php:89
msgid "A team"
msgstr "Een team"

#. translators: 1: team name, 2: number of players in the squad
#: src/Modules/Alerts/Definitions/TeamWithoutHeadCoachAlert.php:94
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s has %2$d player and no head coach."
msgid_plural "%1$s has %2$d players and no head coach."
msgstr[0] "%1$s heeft %2$d speler en geen hoofdtrainer."
msgstr[1] "%1$s heeft %2$d spelers en geen hoofdtrainer."

#: src/Modules/Alerts/Domain/Severity.php:51
