#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/MatrixPage.php:70
msgid ""
"Define what each persona can do on each entity. R = read, C = change (edit), "
"D = create/delete. Scope narrows the grant: \"global\" applies everywhere; "
"\"team\" or \"player\" require the user to also have that scope assignment."
msgstr ""
"Definieer wat elke persona mag doen op elke entiteit. R = lezen, C = "
"wijzigen, D = aanmaken/verwijderen. Scope perkt de toekenning in: \"global\" "
"geldt overal; \"team\" of \"player\" vereisen dat de gebruiker die scope-"
"toewijzing ook heeft."

