msgid "Activate access control — Authorization Matrix"
msgstr "Toegangsbeheer activeren — Authorisatie­matrix"

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/PreviewPage.php:48
msgid ""
"Compare each user's legacy (capability-based) and new (matrix-based) "
"effective permissions. \"Gained\" means the matrix grants something the old "
"caps didn't. \"Revoked\" means the opposite — review carefully before "
"applying."
msgstr ""
"Vergelijk de oude (op rechten gebaseerde) en nieuwe (op matrix gebaseerde) "
"effectieve rechten van elke gebruiker. \"Verkregen\" betekent dat de matrix "
"iets toekent wat de oude rechten niet deden. \"Ingetrokken\" betekent het "
"omgekeerde — controleer dit zorgvuldig voordat je het toepast."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/PreviewPage.php:52
msgid ""
"Authorization matrix is now active. The user_has_cap filter routes legacy "
"capability checks through MatrixGate."
msgstr ""
"Authorisatie­matrix is nu actief. De user_has_cap-filter routeert legacy cap-"
"checks via MatrixGate."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/PreviewPage.php:54
msgid ""
"Authorization matrix rollback complete. The user_has_cap filter is dormant; "
"native WP capability checks decide again."
msgstr ""
"Authorisatie­matrix-rollback voltooid. De user_has_cap-filter is slapend; "
"native WP cap-checks beslissen weer."

