msgstr ""
"Matrix-gedreven autorisatie is ACTIEF. Legacy cap-checks routeren via "
"MatrixGate."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/PreviewPage.php:65
msgid ""
"Matrix is in shadow mode. Legacy cap checks decide; the matrix is data-only."
msgstr ""
"Matrix is in shadow-modus. Legacy cap-checks beslissen; de matrix is alleen "
"data."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/PreviewPage.php:73
msgid ""
"Activate matrix-driven authorization? Every legacy tt_* capability check "
"will route through MatrixGate. You can roll back at any time."
msgstr ""
"Matrix-gedreven autorisatie activeren? Elke legacy tt_*-cap-check zal via "
"MatrixGate routeren. Je kunt op elk moment terugrollen."

