#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:142
#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:163
msgid "How to use this file"
msgstr "Hoe gebruik je dit bestand"

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:143
msgid ""
"Edit the Matrix sheet to grant or revoke permissions per persona. Save as ."
"xlsx (or .csv) and re-upload via Authorization → Matrix → Import seed."
msgstr ""
"Bewerk het Matrix-blad om permissies per persona toe te kennen of in te "
"trekken. Opslaan als .xlsx (of .csv) en opnieuw uploaden via Autorisatie → "
"Matrix → Seed importeren."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:145
#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:163
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendExportsView.php:646
msgid "Columns"
msgstr "Kolommen"

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:146
msgid ""
"persona — one of: player, parent, assistant_coach, head_coach, team_manager, "
"scout, head_of_development, academy_admin"
msgstr ""
"persona — één van: player, parent, assistant_coach, head_coach, "
"team_manager, scout, head_of_development, academy_admin"

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:147
msgid ""
"entity — the resource being permitted (e.g. players, audit_log, dev_ideas). "
"See Authorization → Matrix in the app for the full list."
msgstr ""
"entity — de resource waarop rechten worden gezet (bijv. players, audit_log, "
"dev_ideas). Zie Autorisatie → Matrix in de applicatie voor de volledige "
"lijst."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:148
msgid "activity — one of: read, change, create_delete"
msgstr "activity — één van: read, change, create_delete"

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:149
msgid "scope_kind — one of: global, team, player, self"
msgstr "scope_kind — één van: global, team, player, self"

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:150
msgid ""
"module_class — fully-qualified PHP class name of the owning module (e.g. "
"TT\\Modules\\Players\\PlayersModule). Leave alone unless you know what you "
"are doing."
msgstr ""
"module_class — fully-qualified PHP-klasse van de eigenaarmodule (bijv. "
"TT\\Modules\\Players\\PlayersModule). Niet aanpassen tenzij je weet wat je "
"doet."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:151
msgid ""
"is_default — 1 = shipped default, 0 = admin-edited. Importer will mark every "
"row as 0 (admin-edited) since the import IS the admin edit."
msgstr ""
"is_default — 1 = standaard, 0 = handmatig aangepast. De importer markeert "
"elke rij als 0 (handmatig aangepast), omdat de import zélf de handmatige "
"aanpassing is."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:153
#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:163
msgid "Rules"
msgstr "Regels"

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:154
msgid "One row per granted permission. To revoke a permission, delete the row."
msgstr ""
"Eén rij per toegekende permissie. Om een permissie in te trekken, verwijder "
"je de rij."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:155
msgid "Import REPLACES the matrix. Anything not in the upload is removed."
msgstr ""
"Importeren VERVANGT de matrix. Alles wat niet in de upload staat, wordt "
"verwijderd."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedExporter.php:156
msgid ""
"A diff preview shows you adds + removes before commit. Reset to defaults "
"remains available to restore the shipped seed."
msgstr ""
"Een diff-preview toont toevoegingen + verwijderingen voor je toepast. Reset "
"naar standaard blijft beschikbaar om de meegeleverde seed te herstellen."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedImporter.php:40
msgid ""
"Upload tmp file is not readable. Your host may have stripped the upload "
"before PHP saw it. Try the CSV format."
msgstr ""
"Het tijdelijke uploadbestand kan niet worden gelezen. Je host heeft de "
"upload mogelijk verwijderd voordat PHP het zag. Probeer het CSV-formaat."

#: src/Modules/Authorization/Admin/SeedImporter.php:49
msgid "Unsupported file type. Use .xlsx or .csv."
msgstr "Bestandstype niet ondersteund. Gebruik .xlsx of .csv."

