msgstr "Kies eerst een bestand om te uploaden."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingHandlers.php:228
msgid "A first and last name are both needed."
msgstr "Een voornaam en achternaam zijn allebei nodig."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingHandlers.php:233
msgid "That does not look like a valid email address."
msgstr "Dat lijkt geen geldig e-mailadres."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingHandlers.php:247
msgid "That person could not be saved. They may already be on the list."
msgstr ""
"Die persoon kon niet worden opgeslagen. Mogelijk staat diegene al op de "
"lijst."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingHandlers.php:412
msgid ""
"The spreadsheet library is not installed on this server, so the template "
"cannot be generated."
msgstr ""
"De spreadsheet-bibliotheek is niet op deze server geïnstalleerd, dus het "
"sjabloon kan niet worden gegenereerd."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:61
msgid "Setup is complete."
msgstr "Installatie is voltooid."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:63
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:1023
msgid "Reset wizard"
msgstr "Wizard opnieuw starten"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:87
msgid "Unknown step."
msgstr "Onbekende stap."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:98
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:115
msgid "Set up your academy"
msgstr "Stel je academie in"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:100
msgid ""
"TalentTrack is a youth football talent management plugin. This wizard "
"creates your first team, your admin profile, and a few defaults so you can "
"start tracking players today. Each step takes about a minute."
msgstr ""
"TalentTrack is een plugin voor talentmanagement bij jeugdvoetbal. Deze "
"wizard maakt je eerste team, je beheerprofiel en enkele standaardwaarden aan "
"zodat je vandaag kunt beginnen met spelers volgen. Elke stap duurt ongeveer "
"een minuut."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:103
msgid ""
"If you would rather see what TalentTrack looks like with sample data first, "
"the demo button below loads a realistic academy dataset. You can wipe it and "
"start over at any time."
msgstr ""
"Wil je liever eerst zien hoe TalentTrack eruitziet met voorbeeldgegevens? "
"Dan laadt de demo-knop hieronder een realistische academiedataset. Je kunt "
"deze op elk moment wissen en opnieuw beginnen."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:107
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:124
msgid "Set up my academy"
msgstr "Mijn academie instellen"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:110
msgid "Try with sample data"
msgstr "Probeer met voorbeeldgegevens"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:127
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:141
msgid ""
"These show up across the plugin: in the dashboard header, on player rate "
"cards, and in printed reports. You can change them later under Configuration."
msgstr ""
"Deze gegevens verschijnen overal in de plugin: in de dashboardkop, op rate "
"cards van spelers en in afgedrukte rapporten. Je kunt ze later wijzigen "
"onder Configuratie."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:134
#: src/Modules/Planning/Frontend/FrontendTeamPlannerView.php:273
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendConfigurationView.php:1615
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:145
msgid "Academy name"
msgstr "Naam academie"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:140
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendConfigurationView.php:1683
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:151
msgid "Primary color"
msgstr "Primaire kleur"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:143
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:154
msgid "Used for headers, links, and the FIFA-style player card."
msgstr "Gebruikt voor koppen, links en de FIFA-achtige spelerskaart."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:147
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:157
msgid "Season label"
msgstr "Seizoenlabel"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:150
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:161
msgid "Free-form. Most clubs use \"2025/2026\" or similar."
msgstr "Vrije tekst. De meeste clubs gebruiken \"2025/2026\" of vergelijkbaar."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:154
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:164
msgid "Date format"
msgstr "Datumnotatie"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:207
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:303
msgid "How much product are you running?"
msgstr "Hoeveel product draai je?"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:209
msgid ""
"TalentTrack ships a lot. Most academies want the development loop first and "
"can turn the rest on whenever they need it. Nothing here is permanent — you "
"can change it any time from Modules."
msgstr ""
"TalentTrack levert veel mee. De meeste academies willen eerst de "
"ontwikkelcyclus en zetten de rest aan zodra ze die nodig hebben. Niets "
"hiervan is definitief — je kunt het altijd wijzigen via Modules."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:212
msgid "Skipping gives you the full academy."
msgstr "Overslaan geeft je de volledige academie."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:213
msgid ""
"That is every module switched on, which is what an install gets when no "
"profile is chosen."
msgstr ""
"Dat is elke module aan, en dat is wat een installatie krijgt als er geen "
"profiel is gekozen."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:219
msgid ""
"This install has already been configured by hand, so choosing here would "
"overwrite decisions somebody made. Review the changes on the Modules page "
"instead, where you can see exactly what would happen before anything is "
"written."
msgstr ""
"Deze installatie is al met de hand ingericht, dus hier kiezen zou "
"beslissingen van iemand anders overschrijven. Bekijk de wijzigingen liever "
"op de Modulespagina, waar je precies ziet wat er zou gebeuren voordat er "
"iets wordt weggeschreven."

#. translators: %s is an install profile name, e.g. "Basics".
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:241
#, php-format
msgid "Review %s"
msgstr "%s bekijken"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:259
msgid "What it includes"
msgstr "Wat erin zit"

#. translators: %s is an install profile name, e.g. "Basics".
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:280
#, php-format
msgid "Use %s"
msgstr "%s gebruiken"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:293
msgid "Skip — give me everything"
msgstr "Overslaan — geef mij alles"

#. translators: 1: install profile name, e.g. "Basics"; 2: number of modules and features changed.
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:308
#, php-format
msgid "This install is now on %1$s. %2$d module or feature was switched."
msgid_plural ""
"This install is now on %1$s. %2$d modules and features were switched."
msgstr[0] ""
"Deze installatie staat nu op %1$s. Er is %2$d module of functie omgezet."
msgstr[1] ""
"Deze installatie staat nu op %1$s. Er zijn %2$d modules en functies omgezet."

#. translators: %d is the number of changes that could not be applied.
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:324
#, php-format
msgid "%d change could not be applied because it is not part of your plan."
msgid_plural ""
"%d changes could not be applied because they are not part of your plan."
msgstr[0] ""
"%d wijziging kon niet worden toegepast omdat die buiten je abonnement valt."
msgstr[1] ""
"%d wijzigingen konden niet worden toegepast omdat die buiten je abonnement "
"vallen."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:335
msgid "Nothing was deleted. You can change this any time from Modules."
msgstr "Er is niets verwijderd. Je kunt dit altijd wijzigen via Modules."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:353
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/OnboardingState.php:64
msgid "Import your squad"
msgstr "Je selectie importeren"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:355
msgid ""
"If you already keep your teams, players and staff in a spreadsheet, bring "
"them in now rather than typing them again. Download the template, fill it "
"in, and upload it."
msgstr ""
"Houd je je teams, spelers en staf al in een spreadsheet bij, haal ze dan nu "
"binnen in plaats van ze opnieuw te typen. Download het sjabloon, vul het in "
"en upload het."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:358
msgid "Nothing is saved until you confirm."
msgstr "Er wordt niets opgeslagen tot je bevestigt."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:359
msgid ""
"Uploading shows you what the file contains, and anything that needs fixing, "
"first."
msgstr ""
"Bij het uploaden zie je eerst wat er in het bestand staat, en wat er nog "
"niet klopt."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:368
msgid "This workbook cannot be imported yet. Nothing was saved."
msgstr "Dit bestand kan nog niet worden geïmporteerd. Er is niets opgeslagen."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:389
msgid "Download the template"
msgstr "Download het sjabloon"

#. translators: 1: upload_max_filesize, 2: post_max_size
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:404
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Server limits on this install: upload_max_filesize = %1$s, post_max_size = "
"%2$s. A workbook larger than the smaller of those is rejected before "
"TalentTrack sees it."
msgstr ""
"Serverlimieten op deze installatie: upload_max_filesize = %1$s, "
"post_max_size = %2$s. Een bestand dat groter is dan de kleinste van die twee "
"wordt geweigerd voordat TalentTrack het ziet."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:410
msgid "Check this file"
msgstr "Dit bestand controleren"

#. translators: %s: the uploaded file name
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:419
#, php-format
msgid "%s is ready to import."
msgstr "%s is klaar om te importeren."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:429
msgid "Upload the file again to confirm and save these records."
msgstr ""
"Upload het bestand opnieuw om te bevestigen en deze records op te slaan."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:436
msgid "Import these records"
msgstr "Deze records importeren"

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:443
msgid "Skip — I do not have a spreadsheet"
msgstr "Overslaan — ik heb geen spreadsheet"

#. translators: %d: number of teams brought in by the import
#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:475
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your import brought in %d team. Add another now if you want, or continue."
msgid_plural ""
"Your import brought in %d teams. Add another now if you want, or continue."
msgstr[0] ""
"Je import heeft %d team binnengehaald. Voeg er nu nog een toe als je wilt, "
"of ga verder."
msgstr[1] ""
"Je import heeft %d teams binnengehaald. Voeg er nu nog een toe als je wilt, "
"of ga verder."

#: src/Modules/Onboarding/Admin/OnboardingPage.php:493
#: src/Shared/Frontend/FrontendSetupView.php:193
msgid ""
"Add one team now. You can add more later under Teams. Players, evaluations, "
"activities, and goals all attach to a team, so we need at least one to make "
"the rest of the plugin useful."
msgstr ""
"Voeg nu één team toe. Meer toevoegen kan later onder Teams. Spelers, "
"evaluaties, activiteiten en doelen horen allemaal bij een team, dus we "
"hebben er minstens één nodig om de rest van de plugin nuttig te maken."

