msgstr "nog niets in de bibliotheek"

#: src/Modules/Training/Wizard/ThemeStep.php:58
msgid ""
"The theme decides which exercises are considered. Leave it open and the "
"generator draws from the whole library."
msgstr ""
"Het thema bepaalt welke oefeningen meedoen. Laat het open en de generator "
"kiest uit de hele bibliotheek."

#: src/Modules/Training/Wizard/ThemeStep.php:66
